    {
      "source": "Configures the <a href=\"../../../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> to be used to lookup <a href=\"../../../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> instances for\n<a href=\"#getPersistentEntity()\"><code>getPersistentEntity()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "配置 <a href=\"../../../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>，以便在调用 <a href=\"#getPersistentEntity()\"><code>getPersistentEntity()</code></a> 时用于查找 <a href=\"../../../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Register a <a href=\"RepositoryFactoryCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactoryCustomizer</code></a> to customize the <a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>repository factor</code></a>\nbefore creating the repository.",
      "translation": "注册一个<a href=\"RepositoryFactoryCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactoryCustomizer</code></a>，以便在创建仓库之前自定义<a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>repository factory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a default <a href=\"../../../spel/EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> (or subclass) from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认创建一个<a href=\"../../../spel/EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a>（或其子类），该实例由<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>提供。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Setter to inject repository fragments. This method is additive and will add another <a href=\"RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a> to\nthe already existing list of <a href=\"RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.RepositoryFragmentsFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.RepositoryFragmentsFunction</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于注入存储库片段的设置器。此方法是累加的，会向已存在的 <a href=\"RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a> 列表中再添加一个 <a href=\"RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.RepositoryFragmentsFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.RepositoryFragmentsFunction</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport</code></a> for the given repository interface.",
      "translation": "为给定的仓库接口创建一个新的<a href=\"RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create the actual <a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactorySupport</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "创建实际的<a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core.support 中的类\"><code>RepositoryFactorySupport</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns <a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a> the repository factory is using.",
      "translation": "返回仓库工厂所使用的<a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core 中的接口\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all <a href=\"../../query/QueryMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>QueryMethod</code></a>s declared for that repository.",
      "translation": "返回为该存储库声明的所有<a href=\"../../query/QueryMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>QueryMethod</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"RepositoryFragmentsContributor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFragmentsContributor</code></a> that is used to contribute additional fragments based on the\nrepository declaration.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a href=\"RepositoryFragmentsContributor.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core.support 中的接口\"><code>RepositoryFragmentsContributor</code></a>，该贡献者用于根据仓库声明提供额外的片段。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../RepositoryInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryInformation</code></a> to determine meta-information about the repository being used.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a href=\"../RepositoryInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core 中的接口\"><code>RepositoryInformation</code></a>，用于确定有关正在使用的存储库的元信息。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Sets the <a href=\"../../../spel/EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> to be used to evaluate SpEL expressions in manually defined queries.",
