    {
      "source": "Default is <code>false</code>, in order to avoid unnecessary extra interception. This means that no guarantees are\nprovided that <code>RepositoryMethodContext</code> access will work consistently within any method of the advised\nobject.",
      "translation": "默认为 `<code>false</code>`，以避免不必要的额外拦截。这意味着无法保证在任何被建议对象的任何方法中都能一致地访问 `<code>RepositoryMethodContext</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses may pass-thru generics, provide a fixed domain, provide a fixed identifier type, or provide additional\ngeneric type parameters. Type parameters must appear in the same order the ones from this class (repository type,\nentity type, identifier type, additional type parameters). Using a different ordering will result in invalid type\ndefinitions.",
      "translation": "子类可以透传泛型、提供固定域、提供固定的标识符类型，或提供额外的泛型类型参数。类型参数的顺序必须与本类中的顺序一致（即仓库类型、实体类型、标识符类型、额外类型参数）。使用不同的顺序将导致无效的类型定义。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Functional interface to obtain <a href=\"RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a> for a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> (can be\nnull), <a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a> and <a href=\"../../query/ValueExpressionDelegate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ValueExpressionDelegate</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于获取给定<a href=\"RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a>的功能接口，该给定对象包括一个可能为 null 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>、一个<a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a>以及一个<a href=\"../../query/ValueExpressionDelegate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ValueExpressionDelegate</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../../../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> managed by the underlying repository. Can be null in case the\nunderlying persistence mechanism does not expose a <a href=\"../../../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回底层仓库管理的<a href=\"../../../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。如果底层持久化机制未暴露一个<a href=\"../../../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.context 中的接口\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>，则可能返回 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
