    {
      "source": "Configures the repository base class to use when creating the repository. If not set, the factory will use the type\nreturned by <a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html#getRepositoryBaseClass(org.springframework.data.repository.core.RepositoryMetadata)\"><code>RepositoryFactorySupport.getRepositoryBaseClass(RepositoryMetadata)</code></a> by default.",
      "translation": "配置创建仓库时使用的仓库基类。如果未设置，工厂将默认使用 <a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html#getRepositoryBaseClass(org.springframework.data.repository.core.RepositoryMetadata)\"><code>RepositoryFactorySupport.getRepositoryBaseClass(RepositoryMetadata)</code></a> 返回的类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Setter to provide a single a custom repository implementation. Single custom implementations are considered first\nwhen determining target method invocations routing. Single custom implementations were superseded by\n<a href=\"RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a> that provide a more flexible way to compose repository implementations from multiple\nfragments consisting of a fragment interface and its implementation.",
      "translation": "Setter 用于提供单个自定义仓库实现。在确定目标方法调用路由时，单个自定义实现会被优先考虑。单个自定义实现已被 <a href=\"RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a> 所取代，后者提供了一种更灵活的方式来组合仓库实现，这些实现由多个片段组成，每个片段包含一个片段接口及其实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
